{"module":"before-race","voice":"male","duration":544.9,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"Antes de la raza: de dónde vino el miedo","start":0.0,"end":2.9,"words":[[0.02,0.41],[0.41,0.57],[0.57,0.73],[0.73,1.12],[1.39,1.55],[1.55,1.94],[1.94,2.25],[2.25,2.41],[2.41,2.8]]},{"el":"intro","text":"Mucha gente pregunta por qué el acoso contra las personas negras, morenas e indígenas ha durado tanto, y si algún origen olvidado lo explica.","start":3.7,"end":12.34,"words":[[3.7,4.04],[4.04,4.37],[4.37,4.91],[4.91,5.11],[5.11,5.24],[5.24,5.37],[5.37,5.71],[5.71,6.11],[6.11,6.31],[6.31,6.84],[6.84,7.31],[7.54,8.01],[8.01,8.08],[8.08,8.68],[8.68,8.75],[8.75,9.15],[9.15,9.55],[9.78,9.85],[9.85,9.98],[9.98,10.32],[10.32,10.72],[10.72,11.25],[11.25,11.39],[11.39,11.99]]},{"el":"intro","text":"El registro da una respuesta más clara: la raza moderna es reciente, se escribió en la ley a propósito, y se ha defendido con cualquier argumento a mano, incluidas las escrituras y la ciencia.","start":12.69,"end":24.89,"words":[[12.73,12.87],[12.87,13.42],[13.42,13.56],[13.56,13.77],[13.77,14.39],[14.39,14.59],[14.59,15.01],[15.25,15.39],[15.39,15.66],[15.66,16.15],[16.15,16.28],[16.28,16.9],[17.15,17.28],[17.28,17.84],[17.84,17.97],[17.97,18.11],[18.11,18.32],[18.32,18.39],[18.39,19.08],[19.32,19.39],[19.39,19.53],[19.53,19.59],[19.59,20.22],[20.22,20.42],[20.42,20.97],[20.97,21.6],[21.6,21.66],[21.66,22.01],[22.25,22.87],[22.87,23.08],[23.08,23.77],[23.77,23.84],[23.84,23.98],[23.98,24.53]]},{"el":"h0","text":"El mundo antiguo clasificaba a las personas de otra manera","start":25.24,"end":29.1,"words":[[25.26,25.41],[25.41,25.79],[25.79,26.33],[26.33,27.16],[27.16,27.24],[27.24,27.46],[27.46,28.07],[28.07,28.22],[28.22,28.53],[28.53,28.98]]},{"el":"s0","text":"La esclavitud es antigua, pero durante la mayor parte de la historia no se basó en el color de la piel.","start":29.8,"end":36.15,"words":[[29.82,29.96],[29.96,30.65],[30.65,30.79],[30.79,31.35],[31.59,31.87],[31.87,32.36],[32.36,32.5],[32.5,32.84],[32.84,33.19],[33.19,33.33],[33.33,33.47],[33.47,33.96],[33.96,34.1],[34.1,34.23],[34.23,34.51],[34.51,34.65],[34.65,34.79],[34.79,35.14],[35.14,35.28],[35.28,35.42],[35.42,35.76]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Griegos, romanos, egipcios, africanos, árabes y europeos esclavizaron a personas capturadas en guerras, vendidas por deudas o nacidas de madres esclavizadas, y las personas esclavizadas venían de todas las regiones.","start":36.5,"end":51.57,"words":[[36.53,37.16],[37.41,37.98],[38.23,38.86],[39.11,39.82],[40.07,40.49],[40.49,40.56],[40.56,41.13],[41.13,41.98],[41.98,42.05],[42.05,42.61],[42.61,43.32],[43.32,43.46],[43.46,43.89],[44.14,44.7],[44.7,44.92],[44.92,45.34],[45.34,45.41],[45.41,45.91],[45.91,46.05],[46.05,46.47],[46.47,47.39],[47.64,47.71],[47.71,47.92],[47.92,48.49],[48.49,49.34],[49.34,49.83],[49.83,49.98],[49.98,50.33],[50.33,50.54],[50.54,51.18]]},{"el":"s0","text":"La palabra esclavo viene de eslavo, porque en la Edad Media se esclavizó a muchísimos europeos del este.","start":51.92,"end":59.07,"words":[[51.94,52.08],[52.08,52.59],[52.59,53.1],[53.1,53.46],[53.46,53.61],[53.61,54.11],[54.37,54.73],[54.73,54.87],[54.87,55.02],[55.02,55.31],[55.31,55.67],[55.67,55.82],[55.82,56.47],[56.47,56.54],[56.54,57.27],[57.27,57.85],[57.85,58.07],[58.07,58.43]]},{"el":"s0","text":"El historiador Frank Snowden mostró que los escritores griegos y romanos describían a los africanos con curiosidad y a veces admiración, sin la idea de una jerarquía racial fija.","start":59.42,"end":71.52,"words":[[59.45,59.6],[59.6,60.36],[60.36,60.74],[60.74,61.27],[61.27,61.72],[61.72,61.87],[61.87,62.1],[62.1,62.86],[62.86,63.46],[63.46,63.54],[63.54,64.07],[64.07,64.9],[64.9,64.98],[64.98,65.2],[65.2,65.89],[65.89,66.11],[66.11,66.87],[66.87,66.95],[66.95,67.02],[67.02,67.4],[67.4,68.23],[68.5,68.73],[68.73,68.88],[68.88,69.18],[69.18,69.33],[69.33,69.56],[69.56,70.24],[70.24,70.69],[70.69,71.07]]},{"el":"h1","text":"La raza se escribió en la ley (1452–1705)","start":72.42,"end":78.08,"words":[[72.44,72.58],[72.58,72.88],[72.88,73.03],[73.03,73.62],[73.62,73.77],[73.77,73.92],[73.92,74.14],[74.14,77.76]]},{"el":"s1","text":"La idea de que algunas personas están naturalmente destinadas a ser poseídas se fue escribiendo paso a paso:","start":78.78,"end":85.37,"words":[[78.83,78.97],[78.97,79.25],[79.25,79.39],[79.39,79.53],[79.53,80.01],[80.01,80.57],[80.57,80.91],[80.91,81.75],[81.75,82.44],[82.44,82.51],[82.51,82.72],[82.72,83.27],[83.27,83.41],[83.41,83.62],[83.62,84.38],[84.38,84.66],[84.66,84.73],[84.73,85.07]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1452–1455: las bulas Dum Diversas y Romanus Pontifex del papa Nicolás V autorizaron al rey de Portugal a conquistar a “sarracenos y paganos” y reducirlos a esclavitud perpetua.","start":85.72,"end":100.67,"words":[[85.79,90.23],[90.48,90.7],[90.7,91.06],[91.06,91.27],[91.27,91.85],[91.85,91.92],[91.92,92.42],[92.42,93.07],[93.07,93.28],[93.28,93.57],[93.57,94.07],[94.07,94.21],[94.21,95.0],[95.0,95.15],[95.15,95.36],[95.36,95.51],[95.51,96.08],[96.08,96.15],[96.15,96.8],[96.8,96.87],[96.87,97.51],[97.51,97.59],[97.59,98.09],[98.09,98.16],[98.16,98.88],[98.88,98.95],[98.95,99.67],[99.67,100.31]]},{"el":"s1","text":"La trata portuguesa de africanos creció bajo ellas.","start":101.02,"end":104.65,"words":[[101.02,101.17],[101.17,101.54],[101.54,102.21],[102.21,102.36],[102.36,103.03],[103.03,103.47],[103.47,103.77],[103.77,104.22]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1493: Inter caetera otorgó a España las tierras “descubiertas” en América.","start":105.0,"end":111.57,"words":[[105.03,107.06],[107.31,107.66],[107.66,108.15],[108.15,108.57],[108.57,108.64],[108.64,109.06],[109.06,109.27],[109.27,109.69],[109.69,110.53],[110.53,110.67],[110.67,111.23]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Estas bulas se convirtieron en la Doctrina del Descubrimiento, que la Corte Suprema de EE. UU. adoptó en Johnson v. M'Intosh (1823) para negar a las naciones indígenas la plena propiedad de su tierra.","start":111.92,"end":126.09,"words":[[111.93,112.27],[112.27,112.61],[112.61,112.74],[112.74,113.55],[113.55,113.68],[113.68,113.82],[113.82,114.35],[114.35,114.56],[114.56,115.56],[115.8,115.93],[115.93,116.07],[116.07,116.4],[116.4,116.88],[116.88,117.01],[117.01,117.21],[117.55,117.75],[118.09,118.49],[118.49,118.62],[118.62,119.03],[119.03,119.23],[119.56,120.1],[120.1,121.72],[121.95,122.22],[122.22,122.56],[122.56,122.62],[122.62,122.82],[122.82,123.36],[123.36,123.97],[123.97,124.1],[124.1,124.44],[124.44,125.04],[125.04,125.18],[125.18,125.31],[125.31,125.72]]},{"el":"s1","text":"El Vaticano repudió la doctrina en 2023.","start":126.44,"end":130.13,"words":[[126.45,126.59],[126.59,127.17],[127.17,127.67],[127.67,127.82],[127.82,128.39],[128.39,128.54],[128.54,129.76]]},{"el":"s1","text":"La Corte Suprema no.","start":130.48,"end":132.48,"words":[[130.49,130.66],[130.66,131.1],[131.1,131.7],[131.7,131.96]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1662: Virginia decidió que un hijo sigue la condición de la madre, así que los hijos de mujeres esclavizadas, incluidos los hijos de sus esclavizadores, nacían esclavizados.","start":132.83,"end":147.24,"words":[[132.87,134.9],[135.18,135.8],[135.8,136.35],[136.35,136.51],[136.51,136.67],[136.67,136.9],[136.9,137.21],[137.21,137.37],[137.37,138.08],[138.08,138.23],[138.23,138.39],[138.39,138.86],[139.13,139.37],[139.37,139.53],[139.53,139.76],[139.76,140.07],[140.07,140.23],[140.23,140.78],[140.78,141.8],[142.07,142.78],[142.78,143.01],[143.01,143.33],[143.33,143.48],[143.48,143.72],[143.72,144.89],[145.17,145.71],[145.71,146.73]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1667–1705: Virginia declaró que el bautismo no libera a un esclavo (1667), que matar a una persona esclavizada durante una “corrección” no era delito grave (1669), prohibió el matrimonio interracial (1691) y lo reunió todo en los códigos de esclavos de 1705.","start":147.59,"end":171.37,"words":[[147.62,150.93],[151.17,151.73],[151.73,152.21],[152.21,152.35],[152.35,152.48],[152.48,153.03],[153.03,153.17],[153.17,153.59],[153.59,153.65],[153.65,153.79],[153.79,154.28],[154.28,156.2],[156.45,156.58],[156.58,156.93],[156.93,157.0],[157.0,157.2],[157.2,157.69],[157.69,158.44],[158.44,158.93],[158.93,159.13],[159.13,159.75],[159.75,159.89],[159.89,160.1],[160.1,160.51],[160.51,160.86],[160.86,162.79],[163.03,163.51],[163.51,163.65],[163.65,164.34],[164.34,165.03],[165.03,166.82],[167.06,167.13],[167.13,167.27],[167.27,167.68],[167.68,167.95],[167.95,168.09],[168.09,168.3],[168.3,168.78],[168.78,168.92],[168.92,169.47],[169.47,169.61],[169.61,170.99]]},{"el":"s1","text":"El Code Noir de Francia (1685) hizo lo mismo en sus colonias.","start":171.72,"end":177.27,"words":[[171.72,171.86],[171.86,172.13],[172.13,172.4],[172.4,172.54],[172.54,173.01],[173.01,174.85],[175.08,175.29],[175.29,175.42],[175.42,175.76],[175.76,175.9],[175.9,176.1],[176.1,176.71]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Dividir a quienes podían unirse","start":178.17,"end":180.55,"words":[[178.19,178.8],[178.8,178.89],[178.89,179.41],[179.41,180.02],[180.02,180.55]]},{"el":"s2","text":"En 1676, la Rebelión de Bacon unió a sirvientes blancos por contrato y africanos esclavizados en una revuelta armada contra el gobierno de Virginia.","start":181.25,"end":193.22,"words":[[181.27,181.43],[181.43,183.48],[183.75,183.9],[183.9,184.51],[184.51,184.67],[184.67,185.05],[185.05,185.35],[185.35,185.43],[185.43,186.19],[186.19,186.72],[186.72,186.95],[186.95,187.56],[187.56,187.64],[187.64,188.32],[188.32,189.24],[189.24,189.39],[189.39,189.62],[189.62,190.23],[190.23,190.69],[190.69,191.14],[191.14,191.3],[191.3,191.91],[191.91,192.06],[192.06,192.75]]},{"el":"s2","text":"En las décadas siguientes, las leyes de Virginia dieron a los blancos pobres pequeños privilegios (pagos al terminar su servidumbre, el derecho a portar armas, el derecho a golpear a una persona negra) mientras quitaban derechos a todas las personas negras, libres o esclavizadas.","start":193.57,"end":211.93,"words":[[193.62,193.77],[193.77,193.98],[193.98,194.49],[194.49,195.2],[195.46,195.67],[195.67,196.03],[196.03,196.17],[196.17,196.75],[196.75,197.18],[197.18,197.25],[197.25,197.47],[197.47,197.97],[197.97,198.4],[198.4,198.91],[198.91,199.7],[199.7,200.05],[200.05,200.2],[200.2,200.77],[200.77,200.92],[200.92,201.78],[202.03,202.17],[202.17,202.68],[202.68,202.75],[202.75,203.18],[203.18,203.61],[203.86,204.01],[204.01,204.51],[204.51,204.58],[204.58,205.08],[205.08,205.16],[205.16,205.37],[205.37,205.88],[205.88,206.23],[206.49,207.06],[207.06,207.56],[207.56,208.14],[208.14,208.21],[208.21,208.57],[208.57,208.79],[208.79,209.36],[209.36,209.86],[210.12,210.55],[210.55,210.62],[210.62,211.55]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Que las leyes cambiaron está documentado.","start":212.28,"end":215.1,"words":[[212.3,212.43],[212.43,212.64],[212.64,212.97],[212.97,213.58],[213.58,213.85],[213.85,214.66]]},{"el":"s2","text":"El historiador Edmund Morgan sostuvo que la élite usó la raza a propósito para impedir que los blancos y negros pobres volvieran a unirse.","start":215.45,"end":223.5,"words":[[215.47,215.61],[215.61,216.29],[216.29,216.71],[216.71,217.12],[217.12,217.6],[217.6,217.74],[217.74,217.87],[217.87,218.22],[218.22,218.42],[218.42,218.56],[218.56,218.83],[218.83,218.9],[218.9,219.52],[219.52,219.79],[219.79,220.28],[220.28,220.41],[220.41,220.62],[220.62,221.1],[221.1,221.17],[221.17,221.58],[221.58,221.99],[221.99,222.61],[222.61,222.68],[222.68,223.16]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Otros creen que el cambio se debió más a que los africanos esclavizados se volvieron más baratos que los sirvientes ingleses.","start":223.85,"end":231.47,"words":[[223.85,224.2],[224.2,224.56],[224.56,224.7],[224.7,224.84],[224.84,225.27],[225.27,225.41],[225.41,225.77],[225.77,225.98],[225.98,226.05],[226.05,226.2],[226.2,226.41],[226.41,227.05],[227.05,227.91],[227.91,228.05],[228.05,228.69],[228.69,228.9],[228.9,229.4],[229.4,229.54],[229.54,229.76],[229.76,230.47],[230.47,231.11]]},{"el":"s2","text":"La mayoría coincide en que el efecto fue el mismo.","start":231.82,"end":235.21,"words":[[231.82,231.97],[231.97,232.54],[232.54,233.12],[233.12,233.26],[233.26,233.41],[233.41,233.55],[233.55,233.98],[233.98,234.2],[234.2,234.34],[234.34,234.78]]},{"el":"h3","text":"Primero la práctica, después las ideas","start":236.11,"end":239.06,"words":[[236.12,236.68],[236.68,236.84],[236.84,237.57],[237.85,238.41],[238.41,238.65],[238.65,239.05]]},{"el":"s3","text":"En 1944, el historiador trinitense Eric Williams escribió que “la esclavitud no nació del racismo: más bien, el racismo fue consecuencia de la esclavitud”.","start":239.76,"end":251.78,"words":[[239.8,239.94],[239.94,242.06],[242.31,242.45],[242.45,243.15],[243.15,243.86],[243.86,244.14],[244.14,244.77],[244.77,245.34],[245.34,245.48],[245.48,245.62],[245.62,246.33],[246.33,246.47],[246.47,246.82],[246.82,247.03],[247.03,247.59],[247.84,248.05],[248.05,248.41],[248.65,248.79],[248.79,249.29],[249.29,249.5],[249.5,250.34],[250.34,250.49],[250.49,250.63],[250.63,251.4]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Stamped from the Beginning (2016) de Ibram X. Kendi sigue el mismo patrón durante cinco siglos: las ideas racistas se desarrollaron para defender políticas que ya eran rentables.","start":252.13,"end":264.98,"words":[[252.14,252.65],[252.65,252.94],[252.94,253.09],[253.09,253.67],[253.67,254.77],[255.02,255.17],[255.17,255.53],[255.53,255.9],[256.26,256.63],[256.63,256.92],[256.92,257.06],[257.06,257.43],[257.43,257.87],[257.87,258.38],[258.38,258.74],[258.74,259.25],[259.51,259.73],[259.73,260.09],[260.09,260.68],[260.68,260.82],[260.82,261.7],[261.7,261.99],[261.99,262.57],[262.57,263.23],[263.23,263.38],[263.38,263.52],[263.52,263.82],[263.82,264.54]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Thomas Jefferson, que esclavizó a más de 600 personas a lo largo de su vida, planteó la inferioridad negra “solo como una sospecha” en sus Notas sobre el estado de Virginia (1785).","start":265.33,"end":279.15,"words":[[265.34,265.71],[265.71,266.45],[266.71,266.86],[266.86,267.52],[267.52,267.6],[267.6,267.82],[267.82,267.97],[267.97,268.78],[268.78,269.38],[269.38,269.45],[269.45,269.6],[269.6,269.97],[269.97,270.12],[270.12,270.26],[270.26,270.63],[270.89,271.41],[271.41,271.56],[271.56,272.45],[272.45,272.82],[272.82,273.11],[273.11,273.41],[273.41,273.63],[273.63,274.22],[274.22,274.37],[274.37,274.59],[274.59,274.96],[274.96,275.33],[275.33,275.48],[275.48,275.93],[275.93,276.07],[276.07,276.67],[276.67,278.74]]},{"el":"s3","text":"En pocas décadas, “científicos” medían cráneos para probarlo (ver el módulo sobre la ciencia).","start":279.5,"end":285.33,"words":[[279.51,279.64],[279.64,279.98],[279.98,280.52],[280.75,281.49],[281.49,281.96],[281.96,282.43],[282.43,282.7],[282.7,283.24],[283.24,283.44],[283.44,283.58],[283.58,283.98],[283.98,284.32],[284.32,284.45],[284.45,284.99]]},{"el":"h4","text":"De qué se trataba realmente el miedo","start":286.23,"end":288.79,"words":[[286.25,286.41],[286.41,286.58],[286.58,286.75],[286.75,287.34],[287.34,288.1],[288.1,288.27],[288.27,288.69]]},{"el":"s4","text":"El miedo era real.","start":289.49,"end":290.83,"words":[[289.52,289.64],[289.64,289.95],[289.95,290.13],[290.13,290.43]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Era miedo a la rebelión, a la venganza y a perder el poder en las urnas:","start":291.18,"end":295.75,"words":[[291.21,291.4],[291.4,291.73],[291.73,291.79],[291.79,291.92],[291.92,292.51],[292.74,292.81],[292.81,292.94],[292.94,293.46],[293.46,293.52],[293.52,293.59],[293.59,293.98],[293.98,294.11],[294.11,294.44],[294.44,294.57],[294.57,294.77],[294.77,295.16]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Haití, 1791–1804: las personas esclavizadas derrocaron el dominio francés y fundaron la primera república negra libre.","start":296.1,"end":306.6,"words":[[296.12,296.47],[296.71,300.04],[300.28,300.49],[300.49,301.05],[301.05,301.88],[301.88,302.5],[302.5,302.64],[302.64,303.13],[303.13,303.61],[303.61,303.68],[303.68,304.24],[304.24,304.38],[304.38,304.86],[304.86,305.49],[305.49,305.83],[305.83,306.25]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Después, Francia obligó a Haití a pagar 150 millones de francos (rebajados a 90 millones) por su propia libertad, una deuda que Haití pagó durante unos 120 años.","start":306.95,"end":319.0,"words":[[306.99,307.54],[307.79,308.28],[308.28,308.69],[308.69,308.76],[308.76,309.04],[309.04,309.11],[309.11,309.46],[309.46,310.51],[310.51,311.07],[311.07,311.21],[311.21,311.69],[311.69,312.32],[312.32,312.39],[312.39,312.88],[312.88,313.44],[313.68,313.89],[313.89,314.03],[314.03,314.45],[314.45,315.08],[315.32,315.53],[315.53,315.88],[315.88,316.02],[316.02,316.3],[316.3,316.58],[316.58,317.07],[317.07,317.34],[317.34,318.18],[318.18,318.53]]},{"el":"s4","text":"La rebelión de Nat Turner, 1831: después, Virginia y otros estados endurecieron las prohibiciones de enseñar a leer a las personas negras y de los predicadores y reuniones negros.","start":319.35,"end":331.67,"words":[[319.37,319.5],[319.5,320.02],[320.02,320.15],[320.15,320.35],[320.35,320.81],[321.04,322.81],[323.04,323.56],[323.79,324.32],[324.32,324.38],[324.38,324.71],[324.71,325.17],[325.17,325.96],[325.96,326.15],[326.15,326.94],[326.94,327.07],[327.07,327.53],[327.53,327.59],[327.59,327.86],[327.86,327.92],[327.92,328.12],[328.12,328.64],[328.64,329.04],[329.04,329.1],[329.1,329.23],[329.23,329.43],[329.43,330.22],[330.22,330.28],[330.28,330.87],[330.87,331.33]]},{"el":"s4","text":"La Reconstrucción, 1867–1877: los hombres negros votaron y ocuparon cargos, y la cámara baja de Carolina del Sur tuvo mayoría negra.","start":332.02,"end":343.56,"words":[[332.03,332.16],[332.16,333.16],[333.39,337.11],[337.34,337.54],[337.54,337.94],[337.94,338.34],[338.34,338.81],[338.81,338.87],[338.87,339.4],[339.4,339.87],[340.1,340.17],[340.17,340.3],[340.3,340.7],[340.7,340.97],[340.97,341.1],[341.1,341.63],[341.63,341.83],[341.83,342.03],[342.03,342.3],[342.3,342.83],[342.83,343.23]]},{"el":"s4","text":"La violencia supremacista blanca le puso fin, incluido el golpe de 1898 en Wilmington, Carolina del Norte, donde un gobierno birracial electo fue derrocado por la fuerza.","start":343.91,"end":357.18,"words":[[343.91,344.05],[344.05,344.71],[344.71,345.6],[345.6,346.04],[346.04,346.19],[346.19,346.48],[346.48,346.77],[347.03,347.62],[347.62,347.77],[347.77,348.14],[348.14,348.28],[348.28,350.27],[350.27,350.42],[350.42,351.23],[351.48,352.07],[352.07,352.29],[352.29,352.73],[352.99,353.36],[353.36,353.51],[353.51,354.1],[354.1,354.68],[354.68,355.13],[355.13,355.35],[355.35,355.93],[355.93,356.16],[356.16,356.3],[356.3,356.82]]},{"el":"s4","text":"El “reemplazo”: The Passing of the Great Race (1916) de Madison Grant advirtió que los blancos estadounidenses estaban siendo superados en número.","start":357.53,"end":367.36,"words":[[357.56,357.69],[357.69,358.35],[358.58,358.72],[358.72,359.11],[359.11,359.25],[359.25,359.38],[359.38,359.71],[359.71,359.97],[359.97,361.5],[361.73,361.86],[361.86,362.33],[362.33,362.66],[362.66,363.19],[363.19,363.32],[363.32,363.52],[363.52,363.98],[363.98,364.98],[364.98,365.44],[365.44,365.84],[365.84,366.44],[366.44,366.57],[366.57,367.03]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Ayudó a aprobar las cuotas migratorias de 1924.","start":367.71,"end":372.55,"words":[[367.77,368.13],[368.13,368.2],[368.2,368.7],[368.7,368.91],[368.91,369.34],[369.34,370.13],[370.13,370.27],[370.27,372.2]]},{"el":"s4","text":"El mismo miedo, rebautizado como el “Gran Reemplazo”, fue citado por los asesinos de El Paso (2019) y Buffalo (2022).","start":372.9,"end":382.26,"words":[[372.92,373.06],[373.06,373.42],[373.42,373.84],[374.09,374.87],[374.87,375.15],[375.15,375.29],[375.29,375.58],[375.58,376.28],[376.53,376.74],[376.74,377.17],[377.17,377.38],[377.38,377.59],[377.59,378.16],[378.16,378.3],[378.3,378.44],[378.44,378.73],[378.73,379.86],[380.11,380.18],[380.18,380.67],[380.67,381.81]]},{"el":"h5","text":"Cómo se usaron, y se tergiversaron, las escrituras","start":383.16,"end":387.4,"words":[[383.2,383.53],[383.53,383.7],[383.7,384.28],[384.57,384.65],[384.65,384.82],[384.82,385.98],[386.27,386.52],[386.52,387.35]]},{"el":"s5","text":"La “maldición de Cam”.","start":388.1,"end":389.78,"words":[[388.12,388.25],[388.25,388.86],[388.86,389.0],[389.0,389.27]]},{"el":"s5","text":"En Génesis 9:20–27, Noé maldice a Canaán, hijo de Cam, para que sea siervo.","start":390.13,"end":396.67,"words":[[390.15,390.29],[390.29,390.79],[390.79,392.48],[392.73,392.94],[392.94,393.44],[393.44,393.51],[393.51,394.0],[394.25,394.46],[394.46,394.6],[394.6,394.88],[395.13,395.41],[395.41,395.55],[395.55,395.77],[395.77,396.26]]},{"el":"s5","text":"El texto no dice nada sobre el color de la piel ni sobre África.","start":397.02,"end":401.64,"words":[[397.02,397.18],[397.18,397.67],[397.67,397.83],[397.83,398.15],[398.15,398.48],[398.48,398.88],[398.88,399.05],[399.05,399.45],[399.45,399.61],[399.61,399.78],[399.78,400.1],[400.1,400.26],[400.26,400.67],[400.67,401.24]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Vincular la maldición con la piel oscura vino mucho después y se difundió por intérpretes de varias tradiciones.","start":401.99,"end":409.1,"words":[[401.99,402.56],[402.56,402.7],[402.7,403.34],[403.34,403.55],[403.55,403.7],[403.7,403.98],[403.98,404.41],[404.41,404.69],[404.69,405.05],[405.05,405.55],[405.55,405.62],[405.62,405.76],[405.76,406.33],[406.33,406.55],[406.55,407.33],[407.33,407.47],[407.47,407.9],[407.9,408.75]]},{"el":"s5","text":"En el siglo XIX era un argumento proesclavista habitual en los púlpitos estadounidenses.","start":409.45,"end":415.08,"words":[[409.48,409.61],[409.61,409.74],[409.74,410.06],[410.06,410.71],[410.71,410.9],[410.9,411.03],[411.03,411.61],[411.61,412.44],[412.44,412.89],[412.89,413.02],[413.02,413.22],[413.22,413.73],[413.73,414.76]]},{"el":"s5","text":"La “Biblia del esclavo”.","start":415.43,"end":417.76,"words":[[415.44,415.6],[415.6,416.14],[416.14,416.37],[416.37,416.99]]},{"el":"s5","text":"En 1807, una sociedad misionera británica imprimió Select Parts of the Holy Bible, for the Use of the Negro Slaves.","start":418.11,"end":426.87,"words":[[418.13,418.27],[418.27,419.73],[419.98,420.2],[420.2,420.78],[420.78,421.44],[421.44,422.09],[422.09,422.67],[422.67,423.11],[423.11,423.48],[423.48,423.62],[423.62,423.77],[423.77,423.98],[423.98,424.42],[424.68,424.89],[424.89,425.04],[425.04,425.26],[425.26,425.4],[425.4,425.55],[425.55,425.91],[425.91,426.42]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Eliminó la mayor parte del Antiguo Testamento, incluido el relato del Éxodo y la liberación de la esclavitud, y conservó pasajes como “Siervos, obedeced a vuestros amos”.","start":427.22,"end":439.24,"words":[[427.25,427.78],[427.78,427.93],[427.93,428.31],[428.31,428.69],[428.69,428.91],[428.91,429.44],[429.44,430.27],[430.54,431.14],[431.14,431.29],[431.29,431.74],[431.74,431.97],[431.97,432.42],[432.42,432.5],[432.5,432.65],[432.65,433.4],[433.4,433.55],[433.55,433.71],[433.71,434.54],[434.8,434.87],[434.87,435.48],[435.48,436.01],[436.01,436.31],[436.31,436.91],[437.18,437.78],[437.78,437.86],[437.86,438.46],[438.46,438.84]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Las escrituras también fueron el arma más fuerte contra la esclavitud: las personas esclavizadas cantaban sobre Moisés y el Éxodo, y los abolicionistas, desde Frederick Douglass hasta la iglesia negra, basaron en ellas su causa.","start":439.59,"end":455.17,"words":[[439.61,439.83],[439.83,440.56],[440.56,441.07],[441.07,441.51],[441.51,441.66],[441.66,441.95],[441.95,442.17],[442.17,442.61],[442.61,443.05],[443.05,443.19],[443.19,444.0],[444.25,444.47],[444.47,445.06],[445.06,445.93],[445.93,446.52],[446.52,446.89],[446.89,447.32],[447.32,447.4],[447.4,447.54],[447.54,448.06],[448.31,448.38],[448.38,448.6],[448.6,449.7],[449.96,450.32],[450.32,450.91],[450.91,451.49],[451.49,451.79],[451.79,451.93],[451.93,452.44],[452.44,452.88],[453.14,453.65],[453.65,453.8],[453.8,454.16],[454.16,454.31],[454.31,454.75]]},{"el":"h6","text":"El Libro de Enoc y los mitos raciales modernos","start":456.07,"end":459.31,"words":[[456.09,456.25],[456.25,456.67],[456.67,456.84],[456.84,457.17],[457.17,457.25],[457.25,457.5],[457.5,457.91],[457.91,458.58],[458.58,459.24]]},{"el":"s6","text":"1 Enoc es un antiguo libro judío que forma parte de la Biblia de la Iglesia Ortodoxa Etíope; se hallaron fragmentos entre los Rollos del Mar Muerto, y la Carta de Judas (versículos 14–15) lo cita.","start":460.01,"end":473.32,"words":[[460.07,460.28],[460.28,460.57],[460.57,460.71],[460.71,460.85],[460.85,461.35],[461.35,461.7],[461.7,462.13],[462.13,462.27],[462.27,462.63],[462.63,462.98],[462.98,463.13],[463.13,463.27],[463.27,463.77],[463.77,463.91],[463.91,464.05],[464.05,464.55],[464.55,465.19],[465.19,465.76],[466.0,466.15],[466.15,466.64],[466.64,467.36],[467.36,467.71],[467.71,467.92],[467.92,468.35],[468.35,468.56],[468.56,468.78],[468.78,469.28],[469.52,469.6],[469.6,469.74],[469.74,470.09],[470.09,470.23],[470.23,470.59],[470.59,471.3],[471.3,472.23],[472.47,472.62],[472.62,472.97]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Cuenta cómo unos ángeles llamados los Vigilantes bajaron a la tierra, enseñaron conocimientos prohibidos y engendraron gigantes (los Nefilim de Génesis 6).","start":473.67,"end":484.14,"words":[[473.7,474.15],[474.15,474.45],[474.45,474.74],[474.74,475.26],[475.26,475.78],[475.78,476.0],[476.0,476.74],[476.74,477.26],[477.26,477.33],[477.33,477.48],[477.48,477.93],[478.19,478.85],[478.85,479.82],[479.82,480.48],[480.48,480.56],[480.56,481.37],[481.37,481.96],[481.96,482.19],[482.19,482.7],[482.7,482.85],[482.85,483.37],[483.37,483.74]]},{"el":"s6","text":"No contiene ninguna enseñanza sobre la raza.","start":484.49,"end":487.92,"words":[[484.49,484.62],[484.62,485.18],[485.18,485.66],[485.66,486.28],[486.28,486.63],[486.63,486.77],[486.77,487.11]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Aun así, movimientos modernos han construido historias raciales sobre el Génesis y Enoc.","start":488.27,"end":494.19,"words":[[488.28,488.5],[488.5,488.78],[489.03,489.81],[489.81,490.38],[490.38,490.52],[490.52,491.23],[491.23,491.8],[491.8,492.37],[492.37,492.73],[492.73,492.87],[492.87,493.37],[493.37,493.44],[493.44,493.79]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Las describimos para que puedas reconocerlas, no porque sean ciertas:","start":494.54,"end":499.19,"words":[[494.57,494.78],[494.78,495.55],[495.55,495.82],[495.82,495.96],[495.96,496.38],[496.38,497.28],[497.53,497.67],[497.67,498.01],[498.01,498.29],[498.29,498.85]]},{"el":"s6","text":"La teología de las “dos simientes” de Christian Identity, una doctrina supremacista blanca que afirma que los judíos y las personas de color descienden de la serpiente o de razas “preadámicas”.","start":499.54,"end":511.79,"words":[[499.56,499.7],[499.7,500.36],[500.36,500.51],[500.51,500.73],[500.73,500.95],[500.95,501.61],[501.61,501.76],[501.76,502.42],[502.42,503.08],[503.33,503.55],[503.55,504.14],[504.14,505.02],[505.02,505.46],[505.46,505.61],[505.61,506.05],[506.05,506.19],[506.19,506.41],[506.41,506.93],[506.93,507.0],[507.0,507.22],[507.22,507.81],[507.81,507.96],[507.96,508.32],[508.32,508.98],[508.98,509.13],[509.13,509.28],[509.28,509.94],[509.94,510.01],[510.01,510.16],[510.16,510.52],[510.52,511.4]]},{"el":"s6","text":"La historia de Yakub de la Nación del Islam, que enseña que un científico llamado Yakub creó a los blancos hace miles de años.","start":512.14,"end":520.29,"words":[[512.17,512.32],[512.32,512.85],[512.85,513.0],[513.0,513.38],[513.38,513.53],[513.53,513.68],[513.68,514.14],[514.14,514.37],[514.37,514.82],[515.09,515.24],[515.24,515.7],[515.7,515.85],[515.85,516.0],[516.0,516.76],[516.76,517.22],[517.22,517.6],[517.6,517.9],[517.9,517.98],[517.98,518.21],[518.21,518.74],[518.74,518.97],[518.97,519.35],[519.35,519.5],[519.5,519.88]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Algunos grupos israelitas hebreos enseñan que los negros, hispanos e indígenas americanos son los verdaderos israelitas y que los demás están malditos.","start":520.64,"end":530.18,"words":[[520.69,521.18],[521.18,521.6],[521.6,522.3],[522.3,522.73],[522.73,523.22],[523.22,523.36],[523.36,523.57],[523.57,524.06],[524.31,524.8],[524.8,524.87],[524.87,525.51],[525.51,526.21],[526.21,526.42],[526.42,526.63],[526.63,527.34],[527.34,528.04],[528.04,528.11],[528.11,528.25],[528.25,528.46],[528.46,528.82],[528.82,529.17],[529.17,529.8]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Estas historias se reflejan unas a otras: cada una afirma que la raza es antigua, fija y cósmica.","start":530.53,"end":537.11,"words":[[530.53,530.89],[530.89,531.47],[531.47,531.62],[531.62,532.2],[532.2,532.49],[532.49,532.56],[532.56,532.99],[533.25,533.54],[533.54,533.76],[533.76,534.19],[534.19,534.34],[534.34,534.48],[534.48,534.77],[534.77,534.92],[534.92,535.5],[535.75,536.04],[536.04,536.11],[536.11,536.69]]},{"el":"s6","text":"El registro histórico muestra lo contrario: la raza es reciente, la hicieron personas y se puede deshacer.","start":537.46,"end":544.04,"words":[[537.48,537.61],[537.61,538.14],[538.14,538.68],[538.68,539.14],[539.14,539.27],[539.27,539.94],[540.17,540.3],[540.3,540.57],[540.57,540.7],[540.7,541.29],[541.53,541.66],[541.66,542.12],[542.12,542.65],[542.65,542.72],[542.72,542.85],[542.85,543.18],[543.18,543.72]]}]}